==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|froit}}, {{m|fro|freid}}, inherited from {{inh|fr|la|frīgidus||cold}} (through a syncopated {{inh|fr|VL.|-}} form {{m|la||*frigdus}}, {{m|la||fricdus}}). {{doublet|frigide|lang=fr}}, a later borrowing.

